.venv/
.venv-tempo/
.cache/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store

# Derived — regenerate with segment.py / sheet.py / pick.mjs / midi.mjs.
out/
public/meows/
public/viz/
public/song/

# Source audio dropped at the root to be processed. Big, and unlike images/ it
# has no licence check standing behind it, so it does not go in the repo.
/*.wav
/*.mp3

# The fetched meow pool. This one IS licence-checked twice, but it is a hundred
# megabytes that fetch-meows.mjs can get back on demand, so it stays local.
raw/

# The score, for the same reason as the audio. A MIDI of the etude is a
# transcription of a composition somebody else wrote, and nothing here has
# checked what may be done with it — which is exactly the check images/ and
# sounds/ each get put through twice. It stays a local input.
/*.mid

# Agent scratch. Currently holds a git worktree — committing it would nest the
# repo inside itself.
.claude/
